__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
.loom-dev/
*.log

# Loom's runtime state. The home directory (`~/.loom`, or `--home`) lives outside the
# repository, so none of this is normally here — these patterns exist so a home pointed
# at the checkout can never be committed. `state.db` holds every transcript, thread,
# setting and approval; `vault/` is the person's knowledge; `artifacts/` holds spilled
# tool output, images and process logs. All anchored to the repository root, because
# `ui/src/components/vault/` is source and must stay tracked.
/.loom/
/.loom-*/
/vault/
/artifacts/
/logs/
/scratch/
/releases/
/secrets.index.json
/supervisor.token
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
